      "en": "saying, “God has forsaken him. Pursue and take him, for no one will rescue him.”",
      "ko": "이르기를 하나님이 저를 버리셨은즉 따라 잡으라 건질 자가 없다 하오니",
      "source_text_hash": "935a1fbed75a384610540df08591933d53685df92a18def908ae41eb2c40a97e",
