      "en": "My mouth will tell about your righteousness, and of your salvation all day, though I don’t know its full measure.",
      "ko": "내가 측량할 수 없는 주의 의와 구원을 내 입으로 종일 전하리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "6d430d46a7f959615cf0e9fafd63c6539a8288ca1bc6ed5f9f0cdd1911a535bf",
      "translation_text_hash": "42222923c753502b742d6cbf6faa1a85ab245af5249b89092826b7a8d0c6f2d0",
