      "en": "God, your righteousness also reaches to the heavens. You have done great things. God, who is like you?",
      "ko": "하나님이여 주의 의가 또한 지극히 높으시니이다 하나님이여 주께서 대사를 행하셨사오니 누가 주와 같으리이까",
      "source_text_hash": "95cb4b3f7f47a07b5a5ba0a32795f32122a0987d798a5bb896b537341458f662",
      "translation_text_hash": "afc467f2886ea679700c24ac3265ee9d8e88526a3561ba3157aeb1056433327f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
