      "en": "My tongue will also talk about your righteousness all day long, for they are disappointed, and they are confounded, who want to harm me.",
      "ko": "내 혀도 종일토록 주의 의를 말씀하오리니 나를 모해하려하던 자가 수치와 무안을 당함이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "fe6d34aaedf65396ccc36c287804d8b7dab17a0f3d47cb71679d07c618df8893",
      "translation_text_hash": "90fca48dd547c3ea3153fee84bc150e6efad90b570ee5f8c5ca7f5f3d113d09b",
